1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,384
Open Reports, Report Groups.

2
00:00:05,384 --> 00:00:09,797
The list shows each group followed by the groups nested in it, and

3
00:00:09,797 --> 00:00:11,390
what each one holds.

4
00:00:11,868 --> 00:00:13,161
Click Add Group.

5
00:00:13,161 --> 00:00:15,396
Enter the Name, such as Service.

6
00:00:15,396 --> 00:00:19,688
The Parent group is None for a top-level group, or any group except

7
00:00:19,688 --> 00:00:21,688
the ones nested in this one.

8
00:00:22,139 --> 00:00:26,629
Display order puts the lower numbers first among the groups that share a

9
00:00:26,629 --> 00:00:30,140
parent; groups with the same number are sorted by name.

10
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,119
Click Save.

11
00:00:31,569 --> 00:00:35,799
To nest a group, choose Add a group inside from a group's actions.

12
00:00:35,799 --> 00:00:40,499
Here Regional goes inside Service, and the list shows it under its parent.

